# Anti-vibecoded UI

DriftZero is an ISRO/SIH vehicle navigator. The screen is a survey console on a phone, not a marketing site. These 20 tells are forbidden in Compose, XML, map chrome, judge mode, and copy.

## Forbidden

1. Purple-to-blue gradients. No Material You purple, indigo splash, or aurora wash on map, splash, or buttons.
2. Gradient-filled title or hero text.
3. Emojis in titles, app bars, mode chips, or section labels.
4. Inter (or Roboto left as the whole type system).
5. Cards whose main identity is a colored stroke.
6. Glassmorphism. No blur, frosting, or translucent panels over the map.
7. Low-contrast dark mode. Grey-on-charcoal labels fail. Body text vs chassis contrast must be at least 7:1.
8. Three equal icon tiles in a row (SaaS feature-row).
9. Marketing pill/badge parked above a headline.
10. Lucide or generic outline-icon soup. No Material icon dump.
11. Untouched Material 3 / default Compose theme (purple primary, 28 dp candy cards).
12. Decorative fade-in on scroll or staggered enter as the visual idea.
13. Finger-following glow, beam, or spotlight.
14. Buttons that fade opacity on press. Use a solid pressed/inset state.
15. Random spacing. 8 dp grid only (8 / 16 / 24 / 32).
16. Em dashes in UI or user-facing docs. Periods or commas.
17. Buzzword copy: seamless, intelligent, next-gen, AI-powered, robust, cutting-edge, unlock, elevate.
18. Italic serif accent words in titles.
19. Space Grotesk, Instrument Serif, or that pairing.
20. Grain or noise over a gradient (or over any branded wash).

## Use this instead

- Chassis near-black olive (`#0B0D0A`), panel `#161A14`, paper ink `#F4F1E8`. Status lamps: phosphor green ok, amber caution, red low-confidence. Own-vehicle marker is a solid PRD blue (`#1E6BFF`), not a brand gradient.
- Type: IBM Plex Sans (or `sans-serif-condensed` until Plex is bundled) for labels. IBM Plex Mono (or `monospace`) for speed, heading, uncertainty, timestamps. Do not introduce Inter, Space Grotesk, or Instrument Serif.
- Map is the product. Opaque instrument strip or solid sheet. No glass overlay.
- Mode chip is a status lamp on the map (GNSS, Assisted, Dead reckoning, Reacquiring, Low confidence), not a badge above a title.
- Few filled navigation marks (heading, satellite lock, mount). Same stroke. No 3-up icon row.
- Copy is nouns and numbers: `34 km/h`, `12 m 95%`, `GNSS age 0.4 s`.
- Dark map: pale roads on a dark olive landmass. Not washed grey.
- Touch targets at least 48 dp. Pressed controls get darker fill or an inset, never opacity fade.

```kotlin
// BAD: default M3 purple + fade + emoji title
Text("🚀 Seamless AI Nav", style = MaterialTheme.typography.displayLarge)

// GOOD: instrument label + mono readout
Text("SPEED", color = InkDim, fontFamily = PlexSans)
Text("34.2 km/h", color = Ink, fontFamily = PlexMono)
```
